{"audit_run_id":"audit:d36fd1c46d1448ca93926eec165a8f5c","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":83,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"Faba bean sowing-time trial: autumn sowing compared with spring sowing of the same"},{"end_column":79,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"cultivar on one uniform experimental field, same seed rate and same management"},{"end_column":82,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"otherwise. Sixty field plots of equal size, thirty per sowing time. Each plot was"},{"end_column":41,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"harvested and assessed once at maturity."},{"end_column":83,"end_line":10,"start_column":1,"start_line":10,"text":"One row is one field plot: the plot's identifier, the sowing time it was assigned,"},{"end_column":82,"end_line":11,"start_column":1,"start_line":11,"text":"and that plot's single end-of-season measurement for each of the six outcomes the"},{"end_column":81,"end_line":12,"start_column":1,"start_line":12,"text":"trial plan declared in advance. There are 60 data rows plus a header row, and no"},{"end_column":55,"end_line":13,"start_column":1,"start_line":13,"text":"blank cells: every plot has a value for every outcome."},{"end_column":81,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"Columns appear in this order. The six outcome columns follow the order the trial"},{"end_column":15,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"plan declared."},{"end_column":43,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"| # | Column | Type | Unit | Description |"},{"end_column":43,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"|---|--------|------|------|-------------|"},{"end_column":93,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"| 1 | `plot_id` | text | none | Plot identifier, `P01` through `P60`. Unique; one per row. |"},{"end_column":134,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"| 2 | `sowing_time` | text | none | Group column. Exactly two possible values: `autumn` and `spring`. Thirty rows carry each value. |"},{"end_column":124,"end_line":24,"start_column":1,"start_line":24,"text":"| 3 | `grain_yield_t_ha` | number | tonnes per hectare | Declared outcome 1. Grain yield of the plot. Two decimal places. |"},{"end_column":132,"end_line":25,"start_column":1,"start_line":25,"text":"| 4 | `pods_per_plant` | number | none (a count) | Declared outcome 2. Pods per plant, averaged over the plot. One decimal place. |"},{"end_column":121,"end_line":26,"start_column":1,"start_line":26,"text":"| 5 | `thousand_seed_weight_g` | number | grams | Declared outcome 3. Weight of one thousand seeds. One decimal place. |"},{"end_column":140,"end_line":27,"start_column":1,"start_line":27,"text":"| 6 | `plant_height_cm` | number | centimetres | Declared outcome 4. Plant height at maturity, averaged over the plot. One decimal place. |"},{"end_column":139,"end_line":28,"start_column":1,"start_line":28,"text":"| 7 | `seed_protein_pct` | number | percent | Declared outcome 5. Seed protein content as a percentage of dry matter. One decimal place. |"},{"end_column":170,"end_line":29,"start_column":1,"start_line":29,"text":"| 8 | `chocolate_spot_severity_pct` | number | percent | Declared outcome 6. Chocolate spot leaf disease severity, as percent of leaf area affected. One decimal place. |"},{"end_column":82,"end_line":33,"start_column":1,"start_line":33,"text":"These are the smallest and largest values in each outcome column across all sixty"},{"end_column":82,"end_line":34,"start_column":1,"start_line":34,"text":"plots. They are descriptive of the file as written; they are not group summaries."},{"end_column":31,"end_line":36,"start_column":1,"start_line":36,"text":"| Column | Minimum | Maximum |"},{"end_column":31,"end_line":37,"start_column":1,"start_line":37,"text":"|--------|---------|---------|"},{"end_column":37,"end_line":38,"start_column":1,"start_line":38,"text":"| `grain_yield_t_ha` | 3.08 | 5.87 |"},{"end_column":34,"end_line":39,"start_column":1,"start_line":39,"text":"| `pods_per_plant` | 7.9 | 23.2 |"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":40,"start_column":1,"start_line":40,"text":"| `thousand_seed_weight_g` | 401.7 | 599.6 |"},{"end_column":37,"end_line":41,"start_column":1,"start_line":41,"text":"| `plant_height_cm` | 81.0 | 128.4 |"},{"end_column":37,"end_line":42,"start_column":1,"start_line":42,"text":"| `seed_protein_pct` | 24.9 | 31.5 |"},{"end_column":47,"end_line":43,"start_column":1,"start_line":43,"text":"| `chocolate_spot_severity_pct` | 2.2 | 25.8 |"},{"end_column":61,"end_line":47,"start_column":1,"start_line":47,"text":"- Comma separated, UTF-8, one header row, Unix line endings."},{"end_column":51,"end_line":48,"start_column":1,"start_line":48,"text":"- No quoting is needed; no field contains a comma."},{"end_column":79,"end_line":49,"start_column":1,"start_line":49,"text":"- Rows are ordered by `plot_id`. Sowing times are interleaved through the plot"},{"end_column":78,"end_line":50,"start_column":3,"start_line":50,"text":"numbers, not blocked, because sowing time was assigned at random across the"},{"end_column":15,"end_line":51,"start_column":3,"start_line":51,"text":"sixty plots."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:2da43a801f0f59e20d28","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:748a0ffff603b12b91825549e1362dddb79ba8f49c8b2